---
export const prerender = true;
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { Guestbook } from '../components/Guestbook';
import '../styles/components/_prose.css';
---

<Base title="about" description="a little about me and this site.">
  <div class="about-content">
    <h1>about</h1>

    <p>
      i'm oddava. i build software mostly, and spend the rest of my time
      reading, losing at games, and wandering into whatever rabbit hole is
      closest.
    </p>

    <p>
      i like software, anime, books, and games, and the odd ways technology
      changes how we live and make things. lately that's meant a lot of backend
      work, some ai, and whatever side project has my attention this week.
    </p>

    <p>
      this site is where i keep the things worth keeping — projects i've made,
      notes i've written down, and thoughts i didn't want to lose.
    </p>

    <p>
      i don't have it all figured out. i'm working most of it out as i go and
      writing the bits that seem useful down along the way.
    </p>

    <p>if any of that sounds like your kind of thing, stick around.</p>
  </div>

  <Guestbook client:idle />
  <noscript>
    <p class="guestbook-noscript">
      the guestbook needs javascript to load and post notes. with it off, you
      can still say hi at <a href="mailto:hello@oddava.me">hello@oddava.me</a>.
    </p>
  </noscript>
</Base>
